    "PublicFunctionManifest": {
      "description": "The public projection of [`FunctionManifest`] served inside the root\n`/inspect` identity descriptor. Like `PublicInspect` it is a typed\nallowlist: the `From` impls below destructure the full structs exhaustively,\nso a newly-added field is a compile error here rather than a silent leak.\n\nWhat it keeps: identity/compat and dependency facts — app id, bundle/inputs\nhashes, function names/kinds/capability summaries, read/write summaries,\ncron and config *declarations* (never values; secrets do not ride the\nmanifest — LLP 0036). What it drops: every executable handler body\n(`IbexModule.source`, `HandlerPlan` step bodies) and `sourceSpan` (a\nsource-path leak). Full source stays only on the gated\n`/_snapback/api/inspect` twin.\n\n@ref LLP 0031#resolved-decisions — D3: public `/inspect` is an identity\n  descriptor; handler source and plan bodies are operational facts for the\n  gated twin only (ENG-23441).",
      "properties": {
        "appId": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "artifactKind": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "bundleHash": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "config": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ConfigEntryDefinition"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        "cronJobs": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/CronJobDefinition"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        "functions": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/PublicFunctionDefinition"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        "generatedAt": {
          "format": "uint64",
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "inputsHash": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "schemaVersion": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "unsupportedDependencyDiagnostics": {
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Diagnostic"
          },
          "type": "array"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "artifactKind",
        "schemaVersion",
        "appId",
        "unsupportedDependencyDiagnostics",
        "functions",
        "cronJobs",
        "config"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
